WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.152 --> 00:00:10.752
The nervousness and racing heart parents feel on their child's wedding day is completely natural.

2
00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:21.528
A wedding is one of life's biggest events, and the parents aren't just guests — they're the true hosts and the venue's first impression, standing at the center of attention from the candle-lighting to greeting guests.

3
00:00:21.864 --> 00:00:29.256
In fact, in a corner of our makeup shop's waiting area, we very often see families rustling open and sharing cheongsimhwan together.

4
00:00:29.592 --> 00:00:38.808
We're not medical professionals so we can't speak to its clinical effects, but from over 20 years on the job, we've seen it give wedding parents real peace of mind.

5
00:00:39.144 --> 00:00:44.616
The simple thought "I've taken it, so I'll be fine now" acts like a placebo,

6
00:00:44.952 --> 00:00:50.184
calming frayed nerves and giving you the confidence to walk the aisle with poise.

7
00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:59.208
That said, if you've never taken it before, try half a dose ahead of time to check for drowsiness or excessive relaxation.

8
00:00:59.544 --> 00:01:04.824
But the most effective natural remedy of all is the compliments you'll hear from guests at the venue.

9
00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:13.416
The moment guests see the elegant look crafted by a professional's careful hands and say, "Oh, you look so lovely today!",

10
00:01:13.752 --> 00:01:19.344
the trembling will fade, replaced by the happiness and confidence of being one of the day's stars.

11
00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:23.064
A well-prepared parent is the most confident and beautiful one.
